+# S006 Data Model
+
+This story has no persistent model or schema change. Its in-memory values are:
+
+| Value | Required fields | Rules |
+|-------|-----------------|-------|
+| Action input | `confirmed`, `id`, `owner`, `due_at` | Only strict boolean confirmation is eligible; confirmed inputs require non-blank id/owner and a UTC ISO-8601 due time. |
+| Reminder payload | `id`, `action_id`, `owner`, `due_at`, `remind_at` | Both timestamps are canonical `Z` strings. `remind_at` is strictly before `due_at`. |
